3dd0c193060d17dc9ce4e5728a4c0d0d1343fd8a35835a702d6fa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9a98edbb20b86f0ff5c699939de050ad98f93bedaf352b2ebbc26021ff3862f7","logical_entry_identity":"e378607eaf9460fa11e99236769ec036de607caf9b8339307483e9fd276d1275","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Blindness immunity: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"致盲免疫："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5d5345d44daa2534fdbd600db82a5c79ddb13d0ec11970b223dc9c5cb3f55973","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9a9b41a3f745fb215688ab6eea2f9a24a66cfa76b5fef32a736ce849ca7c2415","logical_entry_identity":"de2e335e97b03e04a3608fdb33a95d704276354836087ea1724d3019d98da490","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Reverses the polarity of your Cosmic Cycle.  If it's currently contracting, it will begin to expand, firing a homing missile at each target within the radius that deals %0.2f temporal damage.\n\t\tIf it's currently expanding, it will begin to contract, braiding the lifelines of all targets within the radius for %d turns.  Braided targets take %d%% of all damage dealt to other braided targets.\n\t\tThe damage will scale with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"逆转你宇宙圈的极性。如果它正在收缩，它将开始膨胀，向半径范围内的每个目标发射一枚瞄准的飞弹，造成 %0.2f 时空伤害。\n\t\t如果它目前正在扩张，它将开始收缩，将半径范围内所有目标的生命线编织 %d 回合。被编织目标承受对其他编织目标造成的所有伤害的 %d%%。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6ae90789016180043ec181f84760977940ec55f7794d4149f65915e78594ca7f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9a9c200169808410c6ced3e12c44d7a3a5257ee41e02c66a1a640e9ce70c2258","logical_entry_identity":"9bd34ff095f75af773f2ebc4437ff073a54b1545e938d8fcc1c26b08bbaed544","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Insert","source_tag":"_t","target":"插入"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a5505b967d3ab2b4192f39d0953709ff5f0ac97b6d457b616c7c74e6330596e8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9a9d23a39c9bbb02f7f6d4659d616f11854661bd30f64a2cdbdccfdf166a89b3","logical_entry_identity":"0911215bfd5302f4307d95ab2cf8f937faa65be1e6e547757562db081e1b2c0f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The %s lying nearby catches your attention. What draws you to it is not the thing itself, but something burning inside you. You feel contempt for it and all worldly things. This feeling is not new but the power of it overwhelms you. You reach out to touch the object, to curse it, to defile it. And you notice it begin to change. The colors of it begin to fade and are replaced with an insatiable hate. For a moment you hesitate. You know you must choose to resist this manifestation of your curse now and forever, or fall further into your madness.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"地上的%s引起了你的注意。吸引你的并不是物体本身，而是在你心底熊熊燃烧的憎恨之火。你对它充满着憎恨，正如你憎恨着世间万物一般。对你而言，这种感觉已经相当的熟悉，但是这一次，这股憎恨已经快要支配你了。你伸出手触碰它，发自内心地诅咒它、亵渎它。紧接着，你发现它发生了变化。它的光泽开始暗淡，继而充斥着无尽的憎恨。那一瞬间，你犹豫了。你知道命运的抉择正放在面前，要么从今天起抵抗身上的诅咒，并与之对抗终身；要么继续放纵自我，任由诅咒带你堕入这疯狂的深渊。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"74391979ac09a7856e57d1d48715ca0d05231eba86837a60c84aaad934430398","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9aa380e08c80e45161fd1f2e2d2f094b8ed4f089fc22ae463a0294b75079639b","logical_entry_identity":"fd084f6758f49b2688cb87b2806967f13786eaa31bb2fc9b8ce65811db8a55f4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have %s.","source_tag":"log","target":"你拥有%s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4e127912b2eb34f19b86edc4aefba0f0d5066e6368a53a42a624368e4c20505c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9aa995f77687a14a654c428ea265b4204bb775f90b8224d0207b5d3c9cc52341","logical_entry_identity":"6ef02300907f8f1f6ed0da3e17f9d30046f49a98659414e3907ff6b606d7819c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"tempo","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"节奏"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9f7e3c0ec4fcd21627088cc82fe78a0c8c6f2883a0e3bf77aed573699a3e1ace","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9aacdf7a7f90b95c7aa1398074095b4d8d0c060c0cb9640b4ae4cf9e17d46d18","logical_entry_identity":"c967222a329446aaf2f8de1c2f8eb8e2bf78cf16f7ea234e0ad2b2f3a44faaa3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"An animated set of mummy wrappings, without a corpse inside; it seems like it cannot move.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一条蠕动的木乃伊裹尸布，里面没有尸体……它看起来无法移动。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1b4f8f4ae7774818514f382b878d2b9071f1a1bf32dfe3eeff3d69a59e936546","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9abe6c41602f81f8c9baae3ebf07b1850802db16966f370fb26f5aa061b90f63","logical_entry_identity":"0d1079a5fc2f37c91a6f5c41f858d3b06593d010140c676934587d4558b77d0a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"steel plate armour","source_tag":"entity name","target":"钢化板甲"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"52b8f8dc86fd5e164106db248d01b450e27b7470f4172305ce348a805b3323f8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9ac032ca670fa1a26f551550ac6ace2211cc83f4122958e738de486538a6694b","logical_entry_identity":"155fc2432d2fb23bd189500e6e16a24cd661e8b4db4f77a1bf708b240def520a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Inflicts %0.2f mind damage and cripples the target's higher mental functions, reducing cunning by %d and confusing (%d%% power) the target for %d turns.\n\t\tThe damage, cunning penalty, and confusion power will scale with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"造成 %0.2f 精神伤害，并摧毁目标的高级精神系统，降低 %d 灵巧并混乱目标（%d%% 强度），持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t受精神强度影响，伤害、灵巧降幅和混乱强度按比例加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f2bfc305d2d17af15c7eb44cccdb118dea2c71a9a8647aa07ea5c8f370e54fa8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9ac8041a05b892752d6626e8e40e2932dc4042ec0e1d885928c0fe029988b029","logical_entry_identity":"0e6c09f2864901348c20923727a21ac851a4f4a07bf7481a15cf459e01dfb390","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Domination hex","source_tag":"_t","target":"-支配邪术"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"87c0b98933e27f857a2446e0b4c2192a1206a89a8521f7e6addaef1ca40c50ee","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9acb710ce11950bdf22a4222090ee5e4b464fc13d67cf895b3ca651700c8e144","logical_entry_identity":"68db2a0deda6072a8b049f05c304603668ffc1fc69abf