nes at the end of each limb form massive blunt weapons.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只行动缓慢的巨大石化怪物每走一步都会使大地为之震颤。它的身体看起来似乎在不断的颤动和重塑。厚重的石化指尖成为了它强大的钝器。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c0c8365ae64731b0fc6c839c4e26027d37e31e436b818ba4476c2aa293319642","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9afe095bc89426cf8eb42f7e062d089bad20d1bcc9ea6fe0da5a22c447c590b0","logical_entry_identity":"c281f834f2be7539fcdefc5628e1f722502f0bd65d4a47b89eff7f8dbf8534d2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Summon a Dread of level %d that will annoyingly blink around, hexing your foes.\n\t\tIt knows the following spells:\n\t\t- Burning Hex at level %d\n\t\t- Empathic Hex at level %d\n\t\t- Pacification Hex at level %d\n\t\t- Blur Sight at level %d\n\t\t- Phase Door at level %d\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"召唤一个等级 %d 的噩灵。噩灵会四处传送，并对敌人释放邪术。\n\t\t它会使用以下技能：\n\t\t- 燃烧邪术等级 %d\n\t\t- 移情邪术等级 %d\n\t\t- 宁神邪术等级 %d\n\t\t- 模糊视觉等级 %d\n\t\t- 相位之门等级 %d\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"10bcf6fd10d84fbd47931d3c2ea9e427a1e3ece94814b4ed72364ab45798481b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b026a895ce656ae2e258108563dae64c9a493bef8a3725516f751669d6036a0","logical_entry_identity":"6cd0f7f87965a107f84147484b9f014129d28554e8820b8de44c5833614d647a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rescued the merchant from the assassin lord.","source_tag":"_t","target":"从盗贼头目手中救回商人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5e857a51fb9753700d4703a2629446707f069057101aeb090e56c58d755f9318","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b048b1742a6b8735be0fe9f9da51ecf116ac2670b261ba829c8d0def5be7bc7","logical_entry_identity":"771f0dff6922d17164521ed2e1bcb992d1a131cc6c219dcec211dfc5a6cd28a1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Become of the master of bones, creating skeletal minions to do your bidding.","source_tag":"_t","target":"成为白骨之主，创造骷髅军团来执行你的命令。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c7a013515cf89734d94f35a39112e323214d971ead994ca9c0911a88ff95d70f","component":"tome","entry_revi