4378e","logical_entry_identity":"d58ded748ba08b4730361334f91d3a06da2a05802cf44f79448fb89ddf091482","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You summon a Rime Wraith inside of you, an intangible creature, that haunts both foes and allies for %d turns.\n\t\tEvery turn the wraith will select a new target and jump to it.\n\t\tWhen the wraith enters a creature they are covered in hoarfrost for 3 turns:\n\t\t- if friendly: increases cold resistance by %d%%, converts all damage done to cold and increases cold damage by %d%%.\n\t\t- if hostile: reduces cold resistance by %d%% and move %d%% slower\n\t\tWhen selecting a target the wraith prefers one that is not affected by hoarfrost if possible.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你在体内召唤远古冰魂，这是一种无形的生物，可以对敌人和盟友造成影响，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t每一回合，冰魂会选择一个新的目标，然后跳向那个目标。\n\t\t当冰魂进入一个生物体内，那个生物将会被寒霜覆盖，持续 3 回合。\n\t\t- 友方目标：获得 %d%% 寒冷伤害抗性，所造成的所有伤害转化成寒冷伤害，增加寒冷伤害 %d%%。\n\t\t- 敌对目标：降低 %d%% 寒冷伤害抗性，移动速度降低 %d%%。\n\t\t冰魂会优先选择没有被寒霜覆盖的目标。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c1588771f4889c4f12404ffe93ba88f144b4d373d7949af61c605921da5486f9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b559d7100bb0e12bbce2f140a675589104db8ae00a4f8645ec59f1104a93d9f","logical_entry_identity":"8d5739d3ab9312cf87bbcb8ba5cc9c630428e4b90afd9e0e7884ccb832d2c198","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Deals %d darkness damage and saps the foes energy, reducing all damage dealt by %d%% for %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"造成 %d 暗影伤害，并吸收敌人的能量，使其造成的所有伤害降低 %d%%，持续 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b9909583f54feb2f111b1577f284b3351db54ddcdbdd6f32e5dc909bb6a86127","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b5a83eb99bee9932a6632b2ee8f19c39a04a34f19cf00f7a0761ceb48be9bb6","logical_entry_identity":"16476d30acab1c9f6e62d94dd32a82d58c0c1405476652185ea05fa21c9c2ab2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Projectile: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"抛射物："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"804d31e247fe6e01f33addc4e09946ad17ff49aac0202468d0091f28f05