ized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"resonating ","source_tag":"entity name","target":"共鸣的"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4394fbd2d1e334336a603e1395c7e92a96a99c3f91570d9f6a1697c5c7753ff4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b8be9a2a4c6d01a94ad17ca59e9f97b1634bed4edce663d90f7631a1a517f15","logical_entry_identity":"99dc282ee429664d3405b71f80ea6b5c07ca84278054b67b1f6d624135df8383","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A folded up piece of paper with a few notes written on it.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一张折叠起来的纸，上面写着一些笔记。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2da24c4cdc26e981668c1b4bf5e6f3464bcd0d283b407b152488d94a06e8c598","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b8fe2f7b4dd50444d6036ba904b7eaed7cb0919ae4ab6f6b887747efac70ba8","logical_entry_identity":"bf1b6f69c891c44703ea318b4f13b4d6cf0ff11879b920b71d646b30aee1b76e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*The two Sorcerers lie dead before you.*#WHITE#\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*Their bodies vanish in a small cloud of mist, quickly fading away.*#WHITE#\nBut the portal to the Void is already open. It must be closed before the Creator can come through or all will have been in vain!\nAfter searching the remains of the Sorcerers you find a note explaining that the portal can only be closed with a sentient being's sacrifice.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*两个魔法师死在你面前。*#WHITE#\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*他们的尸体化成了一缕青烟，很快消失了。*#WHITE#\n但是虚空传送门已经开启。必须在造物主穿过它之前将其关闭，否则一切努力都会白费！\n你搜索魔法师的遗骸时找到一张便条，上面写着：只有牺牲一个有智慧的生命，才能关闭传送门。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"20a96eebd6ca3ef55f43597c8d44d86b748757a632559db1619a344dc217f33d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9b923b2738711a9784a3ba1304da9c75ba2a07bbfbe12bbe2b1e15bd0ee288a9","logical_entry_identity":"8f3ccc351bdbe2f71a83623f2444e86d1ddb6556d6762f46383799aabe828a94","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"fleetfooted","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"敏足"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"29d990f7b90f1c5269a58fae2beacfab7c66dca713d2